CONCLUSION
================================================================================

The centroid-based element assignment is causing particles to search
in the wrong octree leaves, leading to wrong or missing element assignments.

RECOMMENDED FIX:
1. Implement multi-octant search (check neighboring leaves)
2. Or: Assign elements to ALL overlapping leaves (bounding-box based)

